t(14, 865, """There are no conjectures on this channel .. This channel has shaken many souls that I know from afar and has made their owners tense and floundering! This channel is a resurrection from the graves of resignation, illusions, humiliation, love of submission and infatuation with feebleness, or of understanding what is coming with a deficient understanding, because the opening upon the heart and mind was not complete in the one who backbites and slanders""")

