t(15, 1070, """To everyone who is in the call to Allah and suffers .. to everyone who finds the road hard because of wretches who appeared in his path .. and is saddened by the devils among men .. Listen, may Allah keep us and you safe from every human devil .. 17 years in the call to Allah Almighty on reaching 2025, and with 100% of those who offended, attacked and turned devilish, this was their state and what they hide, like the man in the picture, while the poor servant of Allah understands nothing and knows nothing and says: what is wrong with these people? Why the enmity? Are they hostile to a man who says my Lord is Allah? There is no logic in their enmity! Every time a caller said: Allah .. Allah, they thought he was racing them to a ((position)) they still dream of, while he has no idea at all what is in their souls and minds, the last to understand!! And every time it seemed to them that the caller to Allah Almighty was influencing those who listen to him, many of them appeared like this one in the picture .. while the poor servant was immersed in the love of Allah Almighty and the love of good for His servants, his heart clean toward all people and utterly unaware of hearts that are not sound which presented themselves to people as sound .. The owners of these hearts were always immersed in the image of this rider on a horse .. each of them mounted a horse and began to race .. while the poor servant of Allah sleeps thinking of Allah Almighty and wakes thinking of Allah Almighty, 100% unaware of this strange race that no reason, religion or logic accepts .. This is an example that every caller to Allah Almighty should reflect on, reading these words with awareness; this is an example that will not be concealed, of "Muslims" who, sadly, ruined their hearts when they were in one valley and the caller to Allah Almighty in another .. I am at a river whose water I cannot get enough of, for in it is all that Allah Almighty bestows of manifestations and beauty, while they are busy riding horses and cleaving the dust of the desert of souls and illusions toward a worldly life, positions and posts that are not worth, with my Lord, sanctified be His names and attributes, even the wing of a mosquito, and so it must be in the heart of every Muslim.

An experience worth mentioning .. because concealing the truth is a kind of evil""")

t(15, 2530, """Competing for this world""")

t(16, 890, """Not conjectures without evidence ... but when insight is struck with blindness from standing with darkness, it will be said of my posts that they are conjectures without evidence""")

t(16, 1790, """When people do not understand destiny correctly ... they go astray!! When a question comes to me: we are in the West, should we return to our countries? The answer was always: a person flees from Allah's decree to Allah's decree .. this is the Muslim's method .. he asks Allah for guidance (istikhara) and carries on with his life .. If Allah wills for him to stay, He keeps him there against his will, even if he takes a thousand and one means .. Yes, He will keep you in the West against your will .. and if Allah wills for him to move, He moves him against his will .. Understand .. against your will, it is not by your will .. Yes, He will move you against your will, even if you poured yourself into a wall of a house on a street in the West, a slab of cement was laid over you, the slab dried on you and you became stone with the stone, He will move you to another place .. Sadly we still see that the meaning of destiny is not understood in the minds of a number of Muslims!!

When Allah Almighty wills for you to move, He will push you to take means .. you will find yourself at ease with that .. and He will make the means easy for you .. you will not find the means stalled and frozen .. you will find them made easy .. And if He pushes you to take the means of moving while He, sanctified be His names, wants to teach you a lesson that your travel and moving are forbidden, He will make the means fail for you.""")

t(17, 2260, """My son, you will be tried in this world with a great fitnah .. you will bring to your channel a large number of people ignorant of the religion, and you will introduce them to the people and present them, my son, and because of you they will come to have hundreds of thousands of followers .. My son, you will bear burdens of sin that mountains cannot bear and groan under .. but you will bear them, my son, while laughing .. and you sleep soundly .. and you smile, eat and drink .. My son, you will carry a heavy load with you .. dajjals, peddlers of superstition and ignoramuses, and their door through which they reach the people will be .. you .. and they will lead many people astray, my son .. those people came to know them through you, my son .. My son .. wealth will tempt you .. wealth will ruin you .. and you will consume unlawful gain, plain and clear with no ambiguity, but you will not see it, my son .. you will not understand .. and you will not see!""")

